[[Aurene's Breath]] is a [[Legendary weapon|legendary]] [[torch]] crafted in the [[Mystic Forge]].

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|Are people who already have too much power the only ones who want it? Why do they think they need more? This can't be fixed with weapons or magic, it's just...it's just adults panicking or having tantrums.}}

