== Graphics ==
{{section-stub}}
[[Aurene's Breath]] is a Prismatic Crystallized torch. While drawn, the flame is a shining star held at the mouth of the torch.

;Aura
* The opposite arm of the wielding arm has a prismatic glow applied.

;Footfalls
* The user leaves behind prismatic crystal footprints.

; Skill effects
* Ranged skills will throw [[Aurene's Breath]] instead. This effect changes the following skills:
** {{r}} [[Ranger]]: [[Throw Torch]]
** {{g}} [[Guardian]]: [[Zealot's Fire]]

